@journey name=hl-parity-barnacle title="Half-Life c1a2 barnacle: the tongue of the barnacle over the soda room corridor hooks the player, and one crowbar swing at the top of the haul kills it before the bite (its aim point was inside the ceiling, so no swing ever reached it)" prologue=segment segment_row=18 max_ticks=60000
# Parity journey for the barnacle aim point. Retail: a barnacle hangs below its origin (hull -32..0 under the ceiling) and any DMG_CLUB hit kills it outright (CBarnacle::TakeDamage), so the crowbar is the answer once the tongue has the player. The port aimed at origin + 32, inside the ceiling, so the world trace stopped every swing. Bullets additionally need the render occlusion probe to stop hiding the barnacle (open, docs/parity BN06).
# Route: elevator wait, grate *74 (ENT 62), the crouched duct crawl with the flashlight, end cover *75 (ENT 63), the drop into the soda room, dead-banded legs to about (2818,-783) outside the tongue column of the barnacle at (2800,-832) (slot 2), then into the column, look up, and one swing on the last ticks of the haul.
map c1a2 next x
  @wait expr="i32(LOGIC_PLAYER_POS[2]) != 0" timeout=120
  60
  @checkpoint start
  @wait expr="i32(ENT_PHASE[30]) >= 4000" timeout=400
  @face 4000 right
  @hold f127 until y>=-800 timeout=100
  @face 1018 left
  @hold f-116 s-53 until sym=LOGIC_PLAYER_POS size=4 signed=true offset=0 op=le value=2292 timeout=45
  @hold s-70 until sym=LOGIC_PLAYER_POS size=4 signed=true offset=8 op=ge value=-810 timeout=40
